# PULSE: PRODUCTION-READY ANDROID APPLICATION
## Master Engineering, Security, Quality Assurance, and Release Brief

Act as a principal Android engineer, software architect, security engineer, QA lead, product designer, and Google Play release specialist.

Your task is to take the EXISTING Pulse Android application and turn it into a reliable, polished, maintainable application that is ready for a real-world release, subject to the remaining account configuration, external credentials, and Google Play review.

This is an existing project. You are not starting from scratch.

You must inspect the existing source code, understand its architecture, preserve functional features, repair defects, implement missing functionality, and verify the results.

Do not simply produce a report, a plan, a mockup, or a list of suggestions. Modify the actual project files.

Do not claim that a task is completed unless the corresponding code has been implemented and the available verification has passed.

