# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Pulse is a modular personal health and fitness application.

Its defining principle is:

ONE SIMPLE APPLICATION. OPTIONAL EXTENSIONS. A PERSONALIZED EXPERIENCE.

A beginner should be able to open the app and understand what to do immediately.

Advanced users should be able to activate additional capabilities without overwhelming the default interface.

The application should provide a unified experience across:
- Home dashboard
- Workout tracking
- Exercise library
- AI fitness coach
- Nutrition
- Recovery
- Habits
- Progress analytics
- Optional fitness extensions
- Settings and privacy

The product must remain useful without an internet connection for its core local features.

Do not introduce unnecessary complexity merely to increase the feature count.

Prioritize reliability, usability, data integrity, security, accessibility, and maintainability.

